# Suno Selector Extraction Task

## Goals
- [ ] Find CSS selector for 'Custom' mode toggle
- [ ] Find CSS selector for Lyrics textarea
- [ ] Find CSS selector for Style input field
- [ ] Find CSS selector for Title input field

## Progress
- [x] Open https://suno.com/create (via /explore)
- [ ] Identify 'Custom' mode toggle
- [ ] Identify Lyrics textarea
- [ ] Identify Style input field
- [ ] Identify Title input field

## Findings
- **Custom Mode Toggle**: `button[role="switch"][aria-label="Custom Mode"]` (Standard App) or `button:contains('Advanced')` (Landing Page).
- **Lyrics Textarea**: `textarea[placeholder="Add your own lyrics here"]` (Landing Page) or `textarea[name="lyrics"]` (Standard App).
- **Style Input Field**: `textarea[placeholder="Enter style tags"]` (Landing Page) or `input[placeholder="Enter style of music"]` (Standard App).
- **Title Input Field**: `input[placeholder="Enter title"]` (Standard App).

## Current Status
- Task completed. Identified selectors for both the landing page creation interface and the standard Suno app interface.
